Date:   Mon Dec 29 13:00:34 2025 +0000

    Fix spelltrigger=5 to respect spell group strength checks
    
    Adds IsStrongerAuraActive check before casting spells with
    ITEM_SPELLTRIGGER_ON_NO_DELAY_USE. This prevents weaker spells
    from replacing stronger ones in the same spell group.
    
    Fixes profession tool buffs (hammers, shears, picks) where lower
    tier items were incorrectly overriding higher tier buffs when
    moved in inventory.
    
    🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

